+ *
+ * HZ-EVM-RK3588 board configuration.
+ *
+ * Deliberately minimal: rk3588_common.h already supplies SDRAM layout,
+ * ENV_MEM_LAYOUT_SETTINGS and the default (empty) ROCKCHIP_DEVICE_SETTINGS.
